  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "3C9F1C86B3D9A181",
      "text": "欢迎来到冰柜道馆！\\n需要再听一次\\r\\n道馆测验的说明吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "3C9F1986B3D99C68",
      "text": "冰柜道馆的道馆测验是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]开场表演[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\r\\n……也就是所谓的暖场秀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "3C9F1A86B3D99E1B",
      "text": "在道馆馆主开始现场演出之前，\\n请你在舞台上进行宝可梦对战！\\r\\n用殊死的热斗点燃观众席吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "3C9F1F86B3D9A69A",
      "text": "只要和演出会场的ＭＣ说一声，\\n就能开始道馆测验了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_01",
      "hash64": "75CFDD5A7E891CA8",
      "text": "负责开场表演的训练家，你来了啊！\\n我的名字叫做ＭＣ卡玛！\\r\\n演出会场在这边！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_02",
      "hash64": "75CFE05A7E8921C1",
      "text": "接下来，我要请你用\\n２只宝可梦\\r\\n进行双打对战！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_03",
      "hash64": "75CFDF5A7E89200E",
      "text": "[EMPTY 55]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0037"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_04",
      "hash64": "75CFE25A7E892527",
      "text": "如果你能打出劲爆的双打对战，\\n观众的疯狂会加倍！会场的热度会翻倍！\\r\\n冰柜的雪也会融化成水！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_05",
      "hash64": "75CFE15A7E892374",
      "text": "当道馆馆主兴致勃勃地\\n在被点燃的演出会场上亮相！\\r\\n就算是通过道馆测验了！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_19",
      "hash64": "75CC615A7E86141D",
      "text": "登上舞台后就要开始表演了！\\n你要连赢３场，中途不能退出！\\r\\n做好心理准备，然后来挑战吧！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_06",
      "hash64": "75CFE45A7E89288D",
      "text": "开场表演＆道馆测验！\\n你准备好做劲爆的表演了吗！？[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "DD14BEA998FA3570",
      "text": "OK！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "DD14C1A998FA3A89",
      "text": "还没",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "DD14C0A998FA38D6",
      "text": "我要听说明",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_no_double",
      "hash64": "3CE24182F9EB5218",
      "text": "哎呀！这个道馆测验\\n需要２只能对战的 宝可梦！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_cancel",
      "hash64": "356C8E8436519EE5",
      "text": "这可是个责任重大的工作！\\n拜托你精心做好准备啊！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_07",
      "hash64": "75CFE35A7E8926DA",
      "text": "那好～考验你临场发挥的时候到了！\\n到舞台上去吧！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_20",
      "hash64": "75C8D25A7E82EB49",
      "text": "女士们！先生们！\\n本次演出的开场表演有请\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]连续进行３场双打对战～！！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_21",
      "hash64": "75C8D15A7E82E996",
      "text": "第一个挡在挑战者[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n面前的对手是……[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_30",
      "hash64": "75C54C5A7E7FD1C0",
      "text": "微风任我呼的少年表演者！\\n优漾！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_boy_01",
      "hash64": "8DEC4E6B5ECC8FBA",
      "text": "双打对战……１＋１……\\n你知道答案是什么吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
