    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "A6867CAD00457FC3",
      "text": "观众席的助威声\\n稍微变大了一点！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_22",
      "hash64": "75C8D05A7E82E7E3",
      "text": "冰柜舞台采用了最新技术！\\n这是一个观众的热情越是高涨，\\r\\n灯就会亮得越多的系统！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_23",
      "hash64": "75C8CF5A7E82E630",
      "text": "保持这个劲头，\\n不断地做劲爆的表演吧！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_24",
      "hash64": "75C8D65A7E82F215",
      "text": "继续表演！\\n下一个对战对手是……[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_25",
      "hash64": "75C8D55A7E82F062",
      "text": "挑听众的音乐家！\\n贝夏米！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_musician_01",
      "hash64": "FA28AE5C2161A7D7",
      "text": "弥补弱点，变得更强！\\n这就是２只宝可梦带来的同音与和声。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_system_02",
      "hash64": "A6867DAD00458176",
      "text": "观众席已经是\\n一片热情高涨的气氛！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_26",
      "hash64": "75C8D45A7E82EEAF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]的表演\\n让助威声和灯光都变得更加爆棚了～！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
