      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_27",
      "hash64": "75C8D35A7E82ECFC",
      "text": "想不到是个突如其来的惊喜！\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]竟然会有如此劲爆的表现！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_28",
      "hash64": "75C8DA5A7E82F8E1",
      "text": "下一场就是压台戏了。\\n最后的第３个对手是……[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_29",
      "hash64": "75C8D95A7E82F72E",
      "text": "本人！ＭＣ卡玛！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_31",
      "hash64": "75C54D5A7E7FD373",
      "text": "司仪和宝可梦都手到擒来！\\n看我双双把你玩弄于股掌之间！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_system_03",
      "hash64": "A6867EAD00458329",
      "text": "观众席的热情已达到顶点！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mobs_01",
      "hash64": "FF74B9E15C0EFC45",
      "text": "哇哦～！哇哦～！\\n真是好厉害的对战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mobs_02",
      "hash64": "FF74B6E15C0EF72C",
      "text": "很少能看到这样的呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_13",
      "hash64": "75CC575A7E86031F",
      "text": "谢谢[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n你通过道馆测验了！恭喜！\\r\\n请大家热烈鼓掌～！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_14",
      "hash64": "75CC545A7E85FE06",
      "text": "让人后背忍不住哆嗦的一体感！\\n请主角登场的准备也已就绪！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_15",
      "hash64": "75CC555A7E85FFB9",
      "text": "好了，请大家跟我一起说！\\n今天的主角……[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_16",
      "hash64": "75CC525A7E85FAA0",
      "text": "Come on！\\n深情灵魂饶舌乐……莱～姆！！[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mobs_03",
      "hash64": "FF74B7E15C0EF8DF",
      "text": "莱姆！莱姆！莱姆！\\n莱姆！莱姆！莱姆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "38CC8F00F77B2581",
      "text": "都安静点！！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "38CC8C00F77B2068",
      "text": "你们啊……[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "38CC8D00F77B221B",
      "text": "超高分贝的热度！有人听到会嫉妒！\\n声量创造新纪录！大家高兴才叫酷！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mobs_04",
      "hash64": "FF74B4E15C0EF3C6",
      "text": "耶～！！酷～！！\\n莱姆！莱姆！莱姆！莱姆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "38CC9200F77B2A9A",
      "text": "宝贝，谢谢你的开场表演！\\n只要我来了，就不会让你感到无聊！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_17",
      "hash64": "75CC535A7E85FC53",
      "text": "道馆测验辛苦你了。\\n简直太棒了，谢谢你。[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_mc_18",
      "hash64": "75CC605A7E86126A",
      "text": "莱姆还会继续留在这里一段时间，\\n你先去道馆前台完成报告吧。[VAR 0x0114(003B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "gym_ghost_020_stopper_01",
      "hash64": "F28C613F51AF8081",
      "text": "观众们现在眼里只有道馆馆主！\\n……去前台报告吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
